=========================================================

Two redistributions live under this directory, both governed by CDLA-Sharing-1.0:

1. `amlworld/HI-Small_Trans.csv` and `amlworld/HI-Small_Patterns.txt` — a 500-row
   **slice of the IBM AMLworld dataset**, redistributed as a loader test fixture.
2. `corpus/bronze_quickstart.jsonl.gz` — 220 Bronze narrative records with their embedded
